```

The `1a/1b` sub-numbering on the guard block (line 127) was a pre-existing quirk. Renumbering to `2` and removing the `a/b` sub-notation gives the cleanest match to the doc string in the function header (`deny rules › guard rules › allow rules › mode › policy › AskUser`).

**Files/lines:** `control.rs:127`, `161`, `168`, `186`, `191`.

